    "short_description": "Start a new life in the enchanting town of Portia! Restore your Pa's neglected workshop to its former glory by fulfilling commissions, growing crops, raising animals, and befriending the quirky inhabitants of this charming post-apocalyptic land!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cmore than a worthy alternative to Stardew Valley and one of the first must have games of 2019\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 The Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201ca game that we'd wholeheartedly recommend for anyone who enjoys a splash of colour and the thrills of crafting and exploration. We loved building our reputation as a fledgling builder in the gorgeous town of Portia and had a great time as we expanded our workshop, made lasting relationships, and undertook commissions from our friends and neighbours\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gamereactor<br><br>\u201can achievement in indie game production. The intriguing world, compelling systems, and simple gameplay all makes it a fantastic experience\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 The Digital Fix<br>",
